A majority of people define themselves as more introverted than extroverted=
:

- A 2023 YouGov poll (https://today.yougov.com/society/articles/45537-extro=
verts-have-advantages-introverts-poll?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_DudBNYeVyyIQalCe52I=
