<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-size: 22px; font-weight: =
bold;">Finally, some peace and quiet for the introverts</span><br><br>Are y=
ou relieved it=E2=80=99s January, with no more festive parties on the horiz=
on? Do you avoid coworker happy hours? Do you frequently take lunch solo an=
d spend your working hours at your desk, headphones on? You=E2=80=99re not =
alone =E2=80=94 even if you often prefer to be alone. <br><br>A majority of=
 people define themselves as more introverted than extroverted:&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">A 2023 YouGov <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t=
/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW--T41gKp1lN85n00PDyBCNW6R-97G5HXNttN412xb22-ZW0W7lCd=
LW6lZ3mzW5CqCKK2x9FlVMXY2v4cWKnXW8VTCyg6BdCbDW5qKMcT31xsz1W5MCvGP4gVJvBVlbF=
TB7WzNl6W4vR4_21GZhj2W5SmCly6jD3YtW99vtxg4RNywgW3n1xsC6_x2cNW4GvNbk6K5rbgN2=
