76P49nk4-W6mjFg65fvjQvW75yWl75s8GxMW5vjgwb1K7W0rW7X5w222K7LRRW8Z2vjV75g7-lW=
7BkXzT2L4CLBf8h4LcF04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-h=
s-link-id-v2=3D"wU1qyvZb" target=3D"_blank">poll</a> found that 39% of resp=
ondents identified as either completely or more introverted, while 31% said=
 they were an equal mix. Just 22% identified as more extroverted. <br><br><=
/li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">The Myers-Briggs Co. found that <a href=3D"https://med=
ia.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW--T41gKp1lN85n00PDyBCNW6R-97G5HXNt=
tN412xb22-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3kVW53ZGPD4d5ts_W8ldh9k9ddGYvVqNWb37hFZwqW2z8byN2_hF=
7gW31YPq03YFJ08W7m5JFz6DhzRCW3jyRdR67dQzXN5kfN-MFS_pwW8059j-6-8R9BMQ2WMvmK7=
M3W51r19m8xfQp0VTzWjF3BsNsLV9T14Y6rx0tyW2HXdbQ4y2G__VMsnYQ3J9_tPW8MK0nD4-W2=
ynW1fSmbx7-M071W8LDMYZ8pn-hQW3ftkzd8TWln5W27Pgtd8NtLx9W4SnrHh7zq73yVhG0lG7S=
zSfQW2qKHP57GKxwXW5D1PHY5XK2HKf5c5KgR04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-li=
nk-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"M38ZPJw6" target=3D"_blank">~57%</a> of t=
he US population prefers introversion.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While there=E2=80=99s nothing wrong with eith=
er personality type, it can get tricky for introverts when they=E2=80=99re =
surrounded by schmoozing and small-talk. They may feel forced to participat=
e lest colleagues =E2=80=94 or bosses =E2=80=94 think they lack passion, wh=
ich can lead to burnout. <br><br>In 2012, author Susan Cain published <span=
 style=3D"font-style: italic;">Quiet: The Power of Introverts in a World th=
at Can=E2=80=99t Stop Talking</span>, which <a href=3D"https://media.hubspo=
t.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW--T41gKp1lN85n00PDyBCNW6R-97G5HXNttN412x9s2=
-ZW0W69sMD-6lZ3mfW33lXxy55q1qBW5TXlf62g6PT7W3kjtSm5cVn3vN55LsK68P8JLW5c9JcW=
1HqPx7W69hpkC7mZ7nVN5Bh8_PVYyWhW6qmDWl6kghLmW2n3V8n1rdcxkW4vH6PP8kNdYfW7VWy=
fY6dtjn6W2CDZbK5ljny8N3KBtfrFHK_3N4K_m65nn5H2W40Lf7r2GpDLPVmTRDb2Cqd0rW8S4t=
jh99PHxSN97ztwGCf7RhW2jd8MJ1BLHHlW5QFm2n74wL2Wf6HZnlx04" style=3D"color:#19=
2733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"5p4Kjhgw" target=3D"_blan=
k">led</a> companies and organizations to launch initiatives to support the=
ir more taciturn peers. <br><br>And since the pandemic=E2=80=99s remote wor=
k boom, introverts have become even more open about their work preferences,=
 <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW--T41gKp1lN=
85n00PDyBCNW6R-97G5HXNttN412xb22-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3p6W4-7sLF76P7FSW8Sh47R7rtjVm=
VDYNd61Z4MWtW8vNfhT8TKnsDN7PC5F6v6MJrW21XhXZ7j_hCTW2NM0Xs3SBS6HW3RRnG67MNyj=
