FBXW3F8SwH1NQTYdN7TBCNVH_-C-W4XBmSL896nb6W2SB9t32vQ5mLdrB7lC04" style=3D"co=
lor:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"tUaEn9Jq" target=
=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">The Wall Street Jou=
rnal.</span>&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">What are companies doing?</span> <br><br>A Glassdoor poll found that=
 introverts <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW=
--T41gKp1lN85n00PDyBCNW6R-97G5HXNttN412xbl2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3myW2B4Hps30Vzl6W1=
