y5dx7jkW94L4ft7q_HSyf3S4NYC04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0=
" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"FZUvSlaV" target=3D"_blank">value</a> remote or hyb=
rid work, no mandatory social events, quiet spaces in the office, and async=
 work.</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Pharmaceutical company Bristol-Myers Squibb=E2=80=99s =
office has a quiet room where introverts can recharge. It=E2=80=99s also ha=
d a =E2=80=9CValuably Quiet=E2=80=9D program since 2021 to help supervisors=
 and colleagues understand introverts, from how they best get stuff done to=
 how they show enthusiasm.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Accounting firm KPMG has placed individual desks near =
grouped desks, allowing introverts to listen and be near, but not directly =
in the mix. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Other companies and organizations have been launching =
employee resource groups (ERGs) that offer more introvert-friendly ways to =
socialize =E2=80=94 book clubs, crafts, online forums, etc.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Biopharmaceutical company Sobi=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"ht=
tps://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW--T41gKp1lN85n00PDyBCNW6R=
-97G5HXNttN412x982-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3lHW6_cFWd8154hZW6YDkwn8p1yHtV8v38s3Z86PcW4=
