color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"nnyTuJl8" target=
=3D"_blank">Quiet ERG</a> allows introverts to contribute ideas and perspec=
tives in ways that work for them.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold"><span style=3D"font-weight:=
 normal;"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Fun fact: </span>Beyond extrov=
erts and introverts, there are ambiverts (they=E2=80=99re somewhere in the =
